OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor in court charged with
OL,4,Afive assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Green Party councillor has
OL,7,Fappeared in court after being charged
OL,8,Fwith attacking a member of the public,
OL,9,Fthree police officers and a member of
OL,10,Fpolice staff.
OL,12,FSiobhan Harper-Nunes was arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of assault after police were
OL,14,Fcalled to the junction of Monument Road
OL,15,Fand Hagley Road in the city at about
OL,16,F17:00 BST on 6 August.
OL,18,FThe 66-year-old appeared in front of
OL,19,Fmagistrates in Birmingham on Thursday
OL,20,Fand was released on unconditional bail.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
