OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor in court charged with
OL,4,Afive assaults
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict Judge Michelle Smith adjourned
OL,7,Fthe hearing until 17 September
OL,8,Ffollowing a request from Harper-Nunes'
OL,9,Fsolicitor Georgina Ellis for CCTV
OL,10,Frelating to the case to be reviewed.
